<title>USA: Orbital to buy CTA satellite unit.</title>
<headline>Orbital to buy CTA satellite unit.</headline>
<dateline>DULLES, Va. 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orbital Sciences Corp said Monday it would buy CTA Inc's satellite manufacturing and communications service units for $12 million in cash and $25 million in assumed debt.</p>
<p>The units posted 1996 revenues of $80 million and have an order backlog of more than $150 million, Orbital said in a statement.</p>
</text>
